    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.poster.avif?t=1749831633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.webm?t=1749831633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1574570/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.mp4?t=1749831633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The legendary Choice of Life franchise returns in a new game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gray concrete walls of the living cell, closing the hermetic door at the sound of a siren - all this is commonplace in Gigastructure. Everything here goes its way, until the block is isolated in search of a secret object...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features of the new game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique setting, based on the universe of Gigastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Cool 2D-illustrations, from the best artists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Non-linear plot, where every choice can have unpredictable consequences</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The legendary Choice of Life franchise returns in a new game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gray concrete walls of the living cell, closing the hermetic door at the sound of a siren - all this is commonplace in Gigastructure. Everything here goes its way, until the block is isolated in search of a secret object...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features of the new game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique setting, based on the universe of Gigastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Cool 2D-illustrations, from the best artists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Non-linear plot, where every choice can have unpredictable consequences</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You're just a simple inhabitant of the endless Gigastructure. The best you'll get is seven shifts at a machine and a bowl of feed concentrate, and that for good service to the party.... Is that it? Or do you have a choice?",
